# Per-page PDF/Markdown download artifacts in the built book: the theme's download
# menu is hidden via custom CSS, so these are never reachable by users. Chapter PDFs
# users do get are served from publish/chapters/ (linked in the README).
publish/book/build/*.pdf
publish/book/build/*.md